<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b2f24">
  <title>Konfirmasi Kehadiran Natal</title>
  <link href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/vendor/bootstrap-icons/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="snow-layer" id="snowLayer"></div>

  <header class="hero text-center">
    <div class="lights" aria-hidden="true">
      <% for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) { %><span class="bulb"></span><% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="ornament one"></div>
    <div class="ornament two"></div>

    <div class="container position-relative">
      <h1>Konfirmasi Kehadiran<br>Natal 2026</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Mari merayakan sukacita Natal bersama. Isi konfirmasi kehadiran agar panitia dapat
        mempersiapkan acara dengan lebih baik.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="section-icon"><i class="bi bi-person-check"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1">Konfirmasi Kehadiran</h2>
                  <div class="mini">Silakan isi data dengan benar.</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div id="closedMessage" class="closed mb-4 <%= closed ? '' : 'd-none' %>">
                <div class="fw-bold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-lock-fill me-2"></i>Pendaftaran telah ditutup</div>
                <div class="small">Terima kasih atas partisipasinya. Silakan hubungi panitia jika membutuhkan bantuan.</div>
              </div>

              <form id="rsvpForm">
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label class="form-label" for="name">Nama Lengkap <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                  <input id="name" name="name" class="form-control" type="text" placeholder="Contoh: Budi Santoso" required <%= closed ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="phone">No. WhatsApp <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                    <input id="phone" name="phone" class="form-control" type="tel" placeholder="+628xxxxxxxxxx" required <%= closed ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="guestCount">Jumlah Orang <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                    <div class="custom-select" id="guestSelect">
                      <input id="guestCount" name="guestCount" type="hidden" value="1">
                      <button class="custom-select-toggle" type="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" <%= closed ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
                        <span id="guestSelectText">1 orang</span>
                        <i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i>
                      </button>
                      <div class="custom-select-menu" role="listbox" aria-labelledby="guestCount">
                        <% for (let i = 1; i <= 6; i++) { %>
                          <button class="custom-select-option <%= i === 1 ? 'is-selected' : '' %>" type="button" role="option" data-value="<%= i %>" aria-selected="<%= i === 1 ? 'true' : 'false' %>"><%= i %> orang</button>
                        <% } %>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                  <label class="form-label" for="note">Catatan <span class="mini fw-normal">(opsional)</span></label>
                  <textarea id="note" name="note" class="form-control" placeholder="Tuliskan pesan atau catatan di sini..." <%= closed ? 'disabled' : '' %>></textarea>
                </div>

                <button id="submitBtn" class="btn btn-christmas w-100" type="submit" <%= closed ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
                  <i class="bi bi-send-fill me-2"></i>Kirim Konfirmasi
                </button>

                <div class="text-center mt-3 footer-note">
                  <i class="bi bi-shield-lock me-1"></i>
                  Data digunakan hanya untuk keperluan acara Natal.
                </div>
              </form>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <div class="d-grid gap-4">
            <section class="side-card">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="section-icon"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <div class="fw-bold fs-5">Kuota Kehadiran</div>
                  <div class="mini">Jumlah peserta yang sudah dikonfirmasi</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-end gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="stat-big" id="registeredText"><%= registered.toLocaleString('id-ID') %></div>
                <div class="fs-4 fw-semibold text-secondary mb-1">/ <span id="limitText"><%= config.limit.toLocaleString('id-ID') %></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="progress mb-2">
                <div class="progress-bar" id="quotaBar" style="width:<%= percent.toFixed(1) %>%"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mini">
                <span id="percentText"><%= Math.round(percent) %>% terisi</span>
                <span id="remainingText"><%= remaining.toLocaleString('id-ID') %> slot tersisa</span>
              </div>
              <div class="alert-soft mt-3">
                <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-2"></i>
                Pendaftaran otomatis ditutup saat kuota penuh.
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="side-card">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="section-icon danger"><i class="bi bi-calendar-event-fill"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <div class="fw-bold fs-5">Batas Pendaftaran</div>
                  <div class="mini" id="deadlineLabel"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="countdown">
                <div class="count-box"><strong id="days">00</strong><span>Hari</span></div>
                <div class="count-box"><strong id="hours">00</strong><span>Jam</span></div>
                <div class="count-box"><strong id="minutes">00</strong><span>Menit</span></div>
                <div class="count-box"><strong id="seconds">00</strong><span>Detik</span></div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="side-card">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="section-icon"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill"></i></div>
                <div>
                  <div class="fw-bold fs-5">Informasi Acara</div>
                  <div class="mini">Detail acara menyusul dari panitia.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="event-placeholder">
                <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill"></i>
                <div>
                  <strong>Informasi acara belum tersedia.</strong>
                  <div class="mini">Tanggal, waktu, dan lokasi akan diinformasikan kembali setelah susunan acara final.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-5">
        <div class="quote">"Kemuliaan bagi Allah di tempat yang mahatinggi dan damai sejahtera di bumi."</div>
        <div class="mini mt-2">Lukas 2:14</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div class="modal fade" id="successModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
      <div class="modal-content border-0 rounded-4 overflow-hidden shadow">
        <div class="modal-body text-center p-5 success-pop">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-3 d-grid place-items-center rounded-circle bg-success-subtle text-success success-icon">
            <i class="bi bi-check2" id="feedbackIcon"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="fw-bold" id="feedbackTitle">Terima kasih!</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary mb-4" id="successText">Konfirmasi kehadiran berhasil disimpan.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-christmas px-4" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Tutup</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    window.APP_CONFIG = <%- JSON.stringify(config) %>;
  </script>
  <script src="/vendor/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.9.4/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
